110:def profile_record(profile_name: str, axes: list[str]) -> tuple[dict[str, Any], dict[str, Any]]:
111:    """Return (ProfileBinding record, full profile computation); the record is schema-exact.
112:
113:    D2: the record's ``axes`` is the NORMALISED list ``compute_profile`` returns - not a
114:    ``sorted(set(axes))`` re-derivation - so the escalation basis (the axis count the veto
115:    ran on) and the emitted record cannot disagree.
