Verdict: `FAIL_CHALLENGE`.

All eight maker claims passed independent adversarial checks. The mandated suite ran 521 tests successfully, but it transiently modified tracked candidate data through `tests/test_technology_admission.py`. That violates the acceptance round’s hard read-only rule and blocks acceptance.

The exact side effect was restored from `HEAD`; final `git status --porcelain` is empty, and worktree/index diff checks both returned `0`.

The machine-readable verdict was written to the required external path and validated as JSON. SHA-256: `32690a214570702da69ebca21391109e0a5c48d251d731b4cd9d592ab2695925`.

